Third-party libraries redistributed in the `_full` builds
---------------------------------------------------------

The `_full` variants of a release — the file `sp_full-<version>-linux-<arch>`,
`libsp_full.so.<version>` and `libsp_full.a` — have the following libraries
compiled in.  The THIN variants (`sp-<version>-linux-<arch>`, `libsp.so.<version>`
and `libsp.a`) do NOT contain them: they use the copies installed on the host, so
no third-party code is redistributed in those.

The complete licence texts travel with the release in `licenses/`, each copied
verbatim from the source tree it was built from.

