Rust dependencies
-----------------

The Rust crates this project depends on are consumed unmodified, each under the
licence its own manifest declares (Apache-2.0 / MIT / ISC / BSD-3-Clause); the
exact set and versions are those pinned in `rust/Cargo.lock` at the released
commit.  No Rust dependency is patched in this tree.


Data
----

Device facts and experimental data used by tests and examples are not part of
the published artefacts.  Where such a corpus is redistributable it carries its
own licence and rights statement beside the data, not here.
